ZERO AND NOT AN ABSENCE. §KEEP§THE THIRD TIME IN THIS COLLECTION A
CROSS-CHECK HAS BEEN ASKED WHETHER ITS OWN NORMALISERS ARE ALIVE, THE
ANSWER HAS BEEN "SOME OF THEM ARE DEAD AND NOBODY NOTICED", AND §KEEP§
THE STRUCTURAL REPORTING IS PRE-SEEDED BOTH TIMES.

§KEEP§AND TWO OF THE SIX RULES BELOW ARE DEAD *BY DESIGN* AND ARE
LABELLED SO, WHICH INVERTS THE SIBLING COURSE's CONDITION RATHER THAN
COPYING IT. §KEEP§A RULE THAT NORMALISES AWAY THE DIFFERENCE BETWEEN
AN x8 AND A w8 MAKES THE COMPARISON VACUOUS, AND §KEEP§A CROSS-CHECK
THAT IS VACUOUS REPORTS ZERO DISAGREEMENTS OVER A CORPUS WHERE EVERY
WORD DISAGREES -- WHICH IS THE FIFTH TIME IN THIS COLLECTION THAT SHAPE
HAS OCCURRED AND IT IS THE WORST ONE BECAUSE THE NUMBER IS BELIEVED.


  Two readers over every word of the aarch64 leaf: 9 words, 9 agree,
  0 disagree, and the disagreements are printed above rather than
  summarised. §KEEP§THE THREE THAT REMAINED IN AN EARLIER VERSION OF
  THIS SECTION WERE PURELY PRINTING CONVENTIONS -- `lsl, #1` against
  `lsl #1`, and `#0x6` against `#6` -- §KEEP§AND THE FIRE TABLE IS WHAT
  MADE THEM VISIBLE, BECAUSE A DISAGREEMENT YOU CANNOT CLASSIFY IS A
  DISAGREEMENT YOU CANNOT FIX.

  THE NORMALISER FIRE TABLE, PRE-SEEDED WITH EVERY RULE NAME:

    collapse space                     0
    comma before shift or immediate      10
    hex immediate                      1
    mnemonic case                     16
    drop register size suffix          0   NEVER FIRED -- BY DESIGN
    sp alias                           0   NEVER FIRED -- BY DESIGN

    6 rules, 3 fired, 3 matched nothing.
    THE DEAD ONES: collapse space, drop register size suffix, sp alias
    §KEEP§AND TWO OF THEM ARE DEAD BY DESIGN. §KEEP§THE REST ARE
    REDUNDANT *ON THIS CORPUS* RATHER THAN WRONG, AND THE TWO ARE
    NOT DISTINGUISHABLE IN A FIRE TABLE -- §KEEP§WHICH IS WHY EVERY
    RULE HERE CARRIES ITS REASON AS A DATA FIELD AND NOT AS A
    COMMENT NOBODY READS, AND WHY THE TWO BY-DESIGN ONES ARE
    MARKED IN THE TABLE ITSELF INSTEAD OF BEING LEFT AS ZEROS.

  §KEEP§AND THE COUNTER COUNTS A RULE FIRING WHEN IT CHANGES EITHER
