  APPLIED EVERY RULE TO ONE SIDE ONLY, §KEEP§SO `hex immediate` NEVER
  FIRED, FOR THE REASON THAT THE SIBLING DECODER PRINTS `#0x6` AND THIS
  FILE PRINTS `#6`, §KEEP§AND THAT IS A DISAGREEMENT THE RULE WAS
  WRITTEN TO FIX. §KEEP§A FIRE TABLE THAT COUNTS ONE SIDE IS A TABLE OF
  HOW OFTEN *WE* PRINT THINGS A CERTAIN WAY.

  §KEEP§AND THE COMPARISON IS NOT VACUOUS FOR TWO REASONS, AND BOTH
  ARE PRINTED BECAUSE NEITHER IS THE OBVIOUS ONE:
  §KEEP§THE DENOMINATOR IS 9 WORDS AND EVERY ONE OF THEM IS NAMED BY
  BOTH READERS; §KEEP§AND EVERY RULE THAT FIRED WAS APPLIED TO *BOTH*
  SIDES, §KEEP§SO A NORMALISER CANNOT MAKE THE READERS AGREE BY
