SECTION 18 -- THE HARNESS, THE CORRUPTION SUITE, AND THE TWO-RUN
DETERMINISM CHECK.
==========================================================================

  THE HARNESS IS crosscheck.py AND IT RE-ASKS THE RECORDED OUTPUT. §KEEP§IT
  HAS NO ASSEMBLER, NO DECODER AND NO TOOLCHAIN, AND THAT IS THE
  POINT: §KEEP§A HARNESS THAT CAN RE-MEASURE CAN DISAGREE WITH THE
  ARTIFACT FOR REASONS THAT HAVE NOTHING TO DO WITH WHETHER THE
  ARTIFACT'S SENTENCES ARE STILL TRUE, AND THEN IT TEACHES ITS READER
  TO IGNORE IT.

  RUN:  python3 crosscheck.py compback.out
  THE CORRUPTION SUITE:  python3 corrupt.py
    §KEEP§A HARNESS WHOSE CHECKS HAVE NEVER BEEN SEEN TO FAIL IS A
    RUBRIC, AND THIS COLLECTION HAS RETRACTED FOUR OF THEM FOR EXACTLY
    THAT. §KEEP§THE SUITE CORRUPTS THE RECORDED REPORT TWENTY-TWO WAYS
    AND REQUIRES EVERY ONE TO BE CAUGHT.

  THE DETERMINISM CHECK: compback.out, run1.txt and run2.txt must be
  BYTE-IDENTICAL. §KEEP§AND THE TIMING IS THE EXCEPTION AND THE
  EXCEPTION IS WRITTEN DOWN: §KEEP§section 10 READS A SEPARATE BINARY
  WHOSE OUTPUT IS TIMING, AND THE VERDICTS ARE COMPARED WHILE THE
  RAW NUMBERS ARE NOT, BECAUSE A FILE THAT CONTAINS A CLOCK READING
  AND A FILE THAT IS BYTE-IDENTICAL BETWEEN TWO RUNS CANNOT BOTH BE
  TRUE, AND §KEEP§SAYING WHICH ONE GIVES UP IS THE ONLY HONEST
  OPTION.

  and the check is cmp, run three times by build_samples.sh:

      python3 compback.py --run compback.out
      python3 compback.py --run run1.txt
      python3 compback.py --run run2.txt
      cmp compback.out run1.txt && cmp run1.txt run2.txt

  §KEEP§AND NOTHING IN THIS REPORT IS A CLOCK READING FOR THAT TO BE
  TRUE AT ALL -- §KEEP§THE TICK COUNTS LIVE IN cbbench.out, WHICH IS NOT
  ONE OF THESE THREE FILES AND IS NOT COMPARED, §KEEP§WHICH IS EXACTLY
  WHY THE BANDS EXIST.


